    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold and Bricks is a small game that mixes elements of city builder, roguelite, strategy and tower defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a small town with buildings that combo and synergize with each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the layout, manage your economy and invest your gold in defensive towers to protect yourself from the hordes of enemies invading your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-permanent upgrades that can be unlocked as you play the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-13 different structures that can be combined to form different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-cute visuals</p>",
